// S-709: the `use` of the item of a flow that has it (`gain`), then the `use` of the one of a flow that does not
// (`one`). Both are resolved bindings of the names stage, so the later one is E0304. The `use` of `gain` is a
// true binding, silent.
use dsp.synth.gain.{process_inplace}
use dsp.synth.one.{process_inplace}                 //~ E0304
